--- UIAutomation E2E capability note ---
TeslaSync.App.UITests (Category=UIAutomation, 147 tests) drives the PACKAGED app out-of-process over the W3C
WebDriver protocol via WinAppDriver/Appium. This runner has no WinAppDriver/Appium listener (nothing on
http://127.0.0.1:4723/) and no deployed MSIX, so the suite fails fast BY DESIGN (WinAppDriverSession.EnsureReady
throws UiAutomationUnavailableException; the fixture states it is never silently skipped). apps/windows/run-ui-automation.ps1
classifies exactly this condition as STATUS=BLOCKED, never green/red. These are repo-wide app-shell E2E tests, NOT
part of this surface (this surface adds zero UIAutomation tests). The required surface capability (WinUI 3 /
Windows App SDK / .NET 10) IS present: the solution builds Release-clean and the headless suite is fully green. The
headless suite (Category!=UIAutomation) is the surface gate; the 147 UIAutomation failures are an environment/runner
gap, not a defect.

--- Acceptance criteria ---
[x] Surface renders all web-source states: hidden (onboarded / pre-reveal) + presented (4 steps). Data-lifecycle
    states (loading/error/stale/offline) collapse to hidden (web fetches no data) -- documented precedent.
[x] Binds the onboarded flag via the P1/S8 state-holder (OnboardingWizardViewModel over IOnboardingStore); the view
    does no storage/timer I/O beyond the reveal delay; completion + cross-instance 'onboarded' broadcast are seams.
[x] Every web literal is keyed through the i18n facade with verbatim English fallbacks (translation.onboardingWizard.*);
    no hardcoded English in the view (web source uses no t() -- keys invented per the InstallPrompt precedent).
[x] Accessibility: dialog AutomationProperties.IsDialog + Name(step title) + FullDescription(step description); Skip /
    primary / close carry Narrator names + tooltips; step strip exposes a 'Step N of 4' name; chip is AccessibilityView.Raw;
    Esc closes; focus moves into the card on open and is restored on close; fade/scale honour OS reduce-motion (snap).
[x] Tests: registration, the 4-step catalogue (verbatim titles/descriptions/glyphs/accents), the onboarded helper,
    OnboardingWizardProjection per-step + dot-map + step-progress + clamping + a11y contract, the InMemory/Delegated
    stores (incl. read/write-failure degradation + external completion), the ViewModel (reveal/advance/finish/skip/
    dismiss/external-collapse/dispose), and diagnostics -- 45 tests, all pass (within the 28345-test headless suite).
[x] No TODO/stub/mock/placeholder/Lorem in shipped surface code (PLACEHOLDER_COUNT=0).
[x] Telemetry: view.opened slug=OnboardingWizard via OnboardingWizardDiagnostics, emitted once on first present.

